     "type": "mask_imgtext",
     "title": "Back to<br>\r\nbeginnings<br>\r\nall of being",
     "text": "<p>Drift away from everyday life, embark on a journey into yourself, to your origins, to the essentials: As the smallest, most secluded hideaway in the Alps, at an elevation of 1,550 metres, eriro is a place of regeneration and tranquillity. A place where you can experience the true, authentic way of life on the mountain – in all its simplicity and pristine nature, and even more so in its innate understanding of how little it takes to be happy.&nbsp;</p>",
