    "content": {
     "header": "Architektur",
     "subheader": "",
     "headerLayout": 0,
     "headerPosition": "",
     "headerLink": "",
     "type": "mask_imgtext",
     "title": "Captivating <br>\r\nas the <br>\r\norigins",
     "text": "<p>The eriro Alpine hideaway’s architectural design pays homage to the aesthetic of Alpine ecosystem structural elements, with emphasis on simplicity and traditions of craftsmanship. The interior features a minimalist design that focusses on the essentials. Lovingly handcrafted local materials including wood, wool and loden create an ambience that provides structure and shelter and, just as it did thousands of years ago, protects against the reliably present untamed forces of mountain nature.</p>",
